consultation-protocol.step:
After user approves, write state/spec-sheet.json:
{
  "task": "one-line description of what was agreed",
  "approved_at": "YYYY-MM-DD",
  "approved_files": [
    "path/to/file.py",
    "path/to/new.py"
  ],
  "changes": [
    {"file": "path/to/file.py", "operation": "modify", "summary": "specific change description"},
    {"file": "path/to/new.py", "operation": "create", "summary": "what it contains"}
  ]
}

Use paths relative to the project root (e.g. "scripts/foo.py", not absolute paths).
The hook matches incoming absolute paths by checking whether they end with any approved_files entry.
Overwrite any previous spec-sheet.json — this records the current task's approval.
